  "planning_notes": [
    "Board is Arduino Uno (arduino:avr:uno). Wiring is preserved: TM1637 CLK=D4, DIO=D5; buttons on D2, D3, D7; buzzer on D6; LED on D13.",
    "Buttons are modeled as active-high pressed= true with pullups enabled (active_high=true, pullup=true).",
    "tone_output uses the buzzer pin D6; beep counts/patterns are implemented in SysML using elapsed_ms (not in the device request).",
    "TM1637 shows countdown-related number; numeric mapping from stage remaining time is handled in SysML.",
    "Serial baud is 9600 with framing line_or_idle and idle_timeout_ms=20; reporting cadence and message composition are implemented in SysML. This contract keeps the required serial values in one reporting group gated by process-complete."
  ],
